{"translation-revision-date":"2026-09-21 17:33:51+0000","generator":"GlotPress\/4.1.0","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=n != 1;","lang":"da_DK"},"Add New":["Tilf\u00f8j ny"],"Some errors occurred while deleting the post types: %s":["Der opstod nogle fejl under sletningen af indholdstyperne: %s"],"Failed to create taxonomy.":["Det lykkedes ikke at oprette taksonomien."],"Where this taxonomy appears: REST API, admin UI, and front-end surfaces.":["Hvor denne taksonomi forekommer: REST-API, administratorgr\u00e6nsefladen og frontend-gr\u00e6nsefladerne."],"Edit this taxonomy. Expand the Labels section to adjust labels.":["Rediger denne taksonomi. Udvid afsnittet \u00bbEtiketter\u00ab for at tilpasse etiketterne."],"Define a new taxonomy. Fill in the essentials under General; expand Labels to customize.":["Opret en ny taksonomi. Udfyld de vigtigste oplysninger under \u00bbGenerelt\u00ab; udvid \u00bbEtiketter\u00ab for at tilpasse indstillingerne."],"Add taxonomy":["Tilf\u00f8j taksonomi"],"Quick edit taxonomy":["Hurtig redigering af taksonomi"],"Failed to update taxonomy.":["Det lykkedes ikke at opdatere taksonomien."],"\"%s\" taxonomy updated.":["Taksonomien \"%s\" er blevet opdateret."],"Whether terms can be displayed in the Tag Cloud widget.":["Om termer kan vises i Tag Cloud-widgetten."],"Available in Tag Cloud widget":["Findes i Tag Cloud-widgetten"],"Whether terms are selectable in the theme nav menu builder.":["Om termer kan v\u00e6lges i v\u00e6rkt\u00f8jet til opbygning af temanavigationsmenuen."],"Available in nav menus":["Finnes i navigationsmenuerne"],"Show admin column":["Vis administrator-kolonne"],"Show in Quick Edit":["Vis i hurtigredigering"],"Whether to show the taxonomy in the admin menu. Has no effect when Show admin UI is off; the value is preserved either way.":["Om taksonomien skal vises i admin-menuen. Har ingen virkning, n\u00e5r \u00bbVis admin-brugergr\u00e6nseflade\u00ab